      }
    },
    "With your eyes open, a fold of skin from under your brow droops over the lid, so the crease is hidden or most of the lid is covered." : {
      "comment" : "How to tell the `.hooded` `EyeLid` from the others, in plain words, for the picker.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Saat mata terbuka, kulit di bawah alis turun menutupi kelopak, jadi lipatannya tersembunyi atau kelopaknya hampir tertutup."
