        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "睁眼时，眉下的一层皮肤垂下来盖住眼皮，所以褶皱被藏起来，或者大部分眼皮被盖住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your eyes open, you can see a fold line in your upper lid, with a strip of lid skin between the fold and your lashes." : {
